  "label": "Ableism Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that people with physical disabilities are objects to be used or exploited for parts, reducing their humanity to a physical commodity. This is a form of ableism that mocks and dehumanizes individuals with disabilities by portraying their condition as something to be used for humor or practical purposes rather than respected.",
